  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n- Switch AWS profiles and regions directly within e1s.\r\n- Search and sort resource tables while preserving their state across refreshes.\r\n- Execute container commands using either ECS Exec or AWS Systems Manager.\r\n- Added support for ECS Managed Daemons.\r\n- Improved service updates, task-definition selection, and general reliability.\r\n\r\n"
